=2 Walkthrough
* First you need to to go to the second floor of the house at (G-7) in {z:Southern San d'Oria} and read the diary there until you have read up to Page 4.

!Over the hills and far away slope.jpg|right|The Arrow Shows where you need to fall.
* Speak to {p:Antreneau}, {z:Port San d'Oria} (G-7) to flag the quest.
* Head to {z:Oldton Movalpolos} and kill {m:Moblin Ashman} and {m:Moblin Gurneyman} until they drop a {i:Moblin Hotrok|Moblin Hotrok|1729}. Alternately, you can go to {z:Newton Movalpolos} and kill {m:Moblin Groundman}.
* Head to {z:Uleguerand Range} and climb to the top where {m:Jormungand} spawns.
* At (F-9) you will find a slope leading all the way down to the entrance of the zone.
* Fall down the Southern Slope (the one you see as soon as you zone) and aim for the ledge on your left.
** If you miss the ledge you will have to climb up the mountain and try again.
* Once on the ledge head inside the hole and examine the **???**.
* Trade the {i:Moblin Hotrok|Moblin Hotrok|1729} to the **???** to complete this quest.

